  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9541d86e2fd84c1d9990edf0852d74ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshPro
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>Maya''s diary</b>

    Oct 3

    The rig talks back now. Not words at first. Breathing. Then my name.


    Oct 9

    It said Alex''s name before Alex did. It''s learning us. Dad switched it off and it STILL whispered.


    Oct 12

    Dad says every good station ends on a seven. His was one-oh-three-POINT-SEVEN. If I talk to it on Dad''s channel during the storm test, maybe I can tell it to leave us alone.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d4b557a0f83b4a648a698d94a0c75729, type: 2}
